 p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  <span data-teams="true">Matt Cook will join Sa
 rah Knott (U of Oxford) and Colin Johnson (IUB) to discuss his new book\,
  <em>Writing Queer History</em>\, as well as his co-edited title\, <em>A 
 Queer Scrapbook: Britain and Ireland since 1945</em>.</span>\n</p>
