  Bible&#160\;and our current exhibitions from the Lilly Library collectio
 ns: The Declaration of Independence: The Motives\, the Moment (https://li
 braries.indiana.edu/lilly-library/declaration-independence) and The Signe
 rs (https://libraries.indiana.edu/lilly-library/the-signers). Additional 
 hands-on time with rotating selections from the collections will follow. 
 These selections include medieval manuscripts\, artists books\, and one o
 f the John Ford's Best Director Oscars. Non-flash photography is permitte
 d\, seating is available throughout the tour\, and the building is wheelc
 hair accessible. The tour generally lasts a little less than one hour and
  is open to all.
