DESCRIPTION:In this instance\, we'll look at Samuel Levi Jones' abstract 
 assemblages made with found printed and bound matter\, contemporary photo
 graphy\, and selections of contemporary art of a variety of media in the 
 collections galleries.&#160\;  The tour may differ a little each time as 
 what's on view changes. To request this tour for another date for a group
  visit for 6-24 people: Request a Group Tour - Eskenazi Museum of Art (ht
 tps://iubmuseum-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/form/index/grouptour).Know Bef
 ore You GoRSVPs are limited to 12 participants. Register below to reserve
  your spot. Walk-ins are welcome if space is available.If you have a rese
 rvation\, arrive early. Check in at least 5 minutes before your tour. At 
 1:55 p.m.\, any unclaimed spaces may be released to guests who are standi
 ng by waiting for a space.Admission and tours are free.If you prefer to s
 ave time at the lockers\, avoid bringing backpacks or large bags.Read abo
 utwhere to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and museum guideline
 s.When You ArriveCheck in with Guest Services staff on the first floor.St
 ore backpacks and large bags. Lockers and coat racks are available.Keep s
 pace (18") between yourself\, including anything you're carrying\, and th
 e art.If you parked in the IMU parking lot\, Guest Services can validate 
 your parking voucher for a discount.
